-     detail
+     detail

-         A formula is a `Ledger` from each `Molecule` to its coefficient. It is made from a
-         molecular value with a coefficient (`H[2]*2`) or with `.apply`, and grows with `+`,
-         which adds the coefficients of a molecule that appears in both terms.
+         Una fórmula es un `Ledger` de cada `Molecule` a su coeficiente. Se crea a partir de un
+         valor molecular con un coeficiente (`H[2]*2`) o con `.apply`, y crece con `+`, que suma
+         los coeficientes de una molécula que aparece en ambos términos.

